{{field-3}}, which is an integer." :question/worked-solution "An integer is *even* if it can be written as $2a,$ where $a$ is an integer.\n\nTherefore, we complete our argument as follows:\n\nThe number $n$ is even since\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & =6p-14 \\\\  & =2({{3p-7}_{⏟}}_{a}) \\\\  & =2a,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere we have defined $a=3p-7,$ which is an integer."} {:db/id 17592186406634 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186171925 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ba331138-93b8-5fb0-918b-17dc6d3e4029" :knowledge-point/title "Showing a Linear Expression Is Even"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "62465684-35f7-56e7-a8c9-59e5fdc7b711" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5m+1" :db/id 17592186406598} {:answer/id #uuid "70cbaa83-9e5c-521a-bbe1-c57b5528959b" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5m-2" :db/id 17592186406600} {:answer/id #uuid "ccf1b76c-5596-5376-8f5c-c48910675b17" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5m-1" :db/id 17592186406612}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ccf1b76c-5596-5376-8f5c-c48910675b17" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5m-1" :db/id 17592186406612} :answer-field/id #uuid "111f6182-19f4-5c58-8c35-2cb4c533fe59" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id 17592186406620} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2b80075e-57e7-51bf-8a64-1e4a8686cea2" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5m+1" :db/id 17592186406589} {:answer/id #uuid "31653828-4f9e-5152-9746-e5a44a4b758e" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5m-2" :db/id 17592186406591} {:answer/id #uuid "4cdbc704-8fb2-5008-8a2b-9c51a56eeb98" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5m-