s true. $l$ and $m$ being coplanar and perpendicular lines is a **sufficient** condition for $l\\cap m\\ne ∅$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\""} {:db/id 17592186420701 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186152076 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "6414abb9-00d3-55ea-a1e5-da99999c3ccc" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Necessary or Sufficient Conditions From Implications"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "dd4e79bf-48f6-5054-8a92-7d22fd13b6c0" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186453774} {:answer/id #uuid "55c2d1eb-0dac-55a2-baca-6bb8e8152c96" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186453775}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dd4e79bf-48f6-5054-8a92-7d22fd13b6c0" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186453774} :answer-field/id #uuid "28fead55-7c6e-562d-94d9-49bb978dd0c0" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186454637} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b062392d-ea3d-5d3a-a2ee-f4f2fd2bd312" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186453776} {:answer/id #uuid "ab89074b-fa87-5c72-976a-23f02b7d6839" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186453777}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ab89074b-fa87-5c72-976a-23f02b7d6839" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186453777} :answer-field/id #uuid "7db1f26a-d263-5899-8517-00aaebc4f4d6" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186454638} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e5a6e77d-803e-50d5-913b-e8c699094fc6" :answer/type {:db/id 17