s odd **and** $3$ is prime.\n\nConsider the compound statement above and the following notations:\n\n- $P:2\\text{ is odd}$\n\n- $Q:3\\text{ is prime}$\n\nExpressed in symbolic form, our statement can be written as\n{{field-1}}{{field-2}}{{field-3}}." :question/worked-solution "The word \"and\" is represented by the symbol \"$∧$\".\n\nSo, the sentence reads\n\n$$\n{{2\\text{ is odd}}_{⏟}}_{P}\\,{{\\text{and}}_{⏟}}_{∧}\\,{{3\\text{ is prime}}_{⏟}}_{Q},\n$$\n\nthat is, $P∧Q.$"} {:db/id 17592186496323 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186054643 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "49ab93ca-16ca-5e57-835f-036b59f25d63" :knowledge-point/title "Finding Truth Values of Compound Statements"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7c1e00ff-d8ba-50ec-83c9-71602f652e28" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186495775} {:answer/id #uuid "8775eb4f-db12-5677-a324-4fc8d72001d2" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186495803}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8775eb4f-db12-5677-a324-4fc8d72001d2" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186495803} :answer-field/id #uuid "72f7a99b-3183-507b-ae1f-1ba5d0546e36" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id 17592186496134} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "32d5f6cb-3734-5547-9a47-dac1635e8cbb" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186495628} {:answer/id #uuid "f34aece9-1d06-5842-879a-7654e2341a6d" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186496040}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "32d5f6cb-3734-5547-9a47-dac1635e8cbb" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186495628}